      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Total occlusion of left main coronary artery (LMCA) is a rare manifestation of coronary atherosclerotic disease. The exceptionality of this illness is due to its high mortality rate before any treatment. We report a patient with subacute total occlusion of the LMCA."},
